# M25 VoxBlend (UE UVoxelBlendMeshesTool): Box 100 cm and Sphere 100 cm with a 20 cm gap -> Blend Falloff 40 cm (preview, Accept = new entity "Box VoxBlend", inputs hidden, Undo), then Blend Falloff 5 cm and Cancel. The operator runs in the background; the status frames cover its time.
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.35,1
Дано run Modeling "Create shape tool: Box"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape: place at the viewport centre"
Дано --subject selection set Translation 0,0,0
Дано run Modeling "Create shape tool: Sphere"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape: place at the viewport centre"
Дано --subject selection set Translation 120,0,0
Дано run Entity Box
Дано run Entity "Add to selection Sphere"
Дано run "Level Viewport" "Focus Selected"
Дано run Modeling "VoxBlend inputs: Hide Inputs"
Дано --subject modeling set VoxBlend.VoxelCount 64
Дано --subject modeling set VoxBlend.BlendFalloff 40
Тогда 0_inputs Box at the origin and a Sphere 20 cm to its right, both selected, VoxOps palette
Когда run Modeling "VoxOps tool: VoxBlend"
Тогда 1a_blend_computing the panel status says VoxBlend is computing (DesertCtl has no wait-for-background step, these window frames cover it)
Тогда 1a2_blend_wait still the VoxBlend panel
Тогда 1a3_blend_status the panel status line reports the Blend Falloff 40 cm result
Тогда-вид 1_blend_preview VoxBlend bar (Accept/Cancel); Box and Sphere are fused by a smooth bridge across the gap; the inputs are not drawn
Когда run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Тогда-вид 1_blend a new entity "Box VoxBlend" (box and sphere joined by a smooth bridge); both inputs hidden
Тогда 1b_blend_outliner the outliner shows "Box VoxBlend" selected, Box and Sphere hidden
Когда run Action Undo
Тогда-вид 1_undo the VoxBlend entity is gone; Box and Sphere are visible and separate, no trace of the fused shape under them
Дано run Entity Box
Дано run Entity "Add to selection Sphere"
Дано --subject modeling set VoxBlend.BlendFalloff 5
Когда run Modeling "VoxOps tool: VoxBlend"
Тогда 2a_small_computing the panel status says VoxBlend is computing
Тогда 2a2_small_wait still the VoxBlend panel
Тогда 2a3_small_status the panel status line reports the Blend Falloff 5 cm result
Тогда-вид 2_small_falloff no bridge (or a barely visible one): the box and the sphere stay almost separate
Когда run Modeling "Active tool: Cancel"
Тогда-вид 2_cancel the tool ended; Box and Sphere both visible
